@edit-time 2026-04-21T03:45Z
Fossils of Primal Evolution
@status rough
@pub-time 2026-03-14T00:00Z
@category physics
@term cosmology: TBD
@term evolution: TBD
@term many-worlds: TBD
@term omega-point: TBD
